      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d164383a15fd2a4fb1f9441d3a07d984ac48eab3fa238574391008a2f8d607d1",
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to Santiago Airport with a driver for your flight to Easter Island.\n\nOn arrival, join a group excursion with an English-speaking guide to the ceremonial centre of Orongo. Explore the slopes of Rano Kau volcano and take in the beauty of its crater lake.\n\nContinue to the ceremonial village of Orongo, where the island’s leader was chosen through a perilous ritual contest linked to the sacred Manutara bird. The winning participant earned the title of Tangata Manu, the Birdman.\n\nOvernight at the hotel.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
        "fileId": "18SzywAPCgdKEUPkYKDL05UCtQOGhj0Ob",
        "documentSha256": "5ad921988e8413d36aee91207a7e895c91209d186124ccf72d0324c033d3ee8e",
